			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-61520907 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="61520907" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2>Benefits of Acrylic for Modern Water Features</h2><p>At Midwest Tropical, our goal is to provide our customers with the best possible products for the manufacturing of their water features. We believe the benefits of acrylic are well worth considering as you choose the materials for your next water feature design. Acrylic offers many of the benefits of glass — including the see-through design and natural light filtering — without the drawbacks. Unlike glass, acrylic is impact-resistant and lightweight. Your water feature can weigh significantly less than glass, while resisting damage better. </p><p>This is important, because water creates a significant amount of pressure, and an acrylic water fountain will hold up well under that pressure. Acrylic is weather-resistant, so it is not going to be damaged by the constant exposure to water in one of our designs, nor will it fade with exposure to sunlight. This material won’t yellow or change color over time like other plastics, which is another reason we prefer it for our designs. It is easily shaped and molded, giving our designers great flexibility as we create your custom water feature. As you can see, there are many reasons you should consider an acrylic water feature for your space.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4409a4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4409a4b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2>Our Full List of Acrylic Water Features</h2><p>When you partner with Midwest Tropical for your acrylic water feature, your design is not limited to just a handful of styles. We create numerous water features out of acrylic. Its versatility and strength make it a perfect choice. With the help of Midwest Tropical, you can update and upgrade your space with the following:</p><ul><li><a href="/materials/acrylic-water-features/">Acrylic waterfall</a></li><li><a href="/reflection-pools/">Acrylic fountain</a></li><li><a href="/bubble-tubes/">Acrylic bubble tubes</a></li><li><a href="/waterwalls/">Acrylic water wall</a></li></ul><p> If you can imagine it, chances are we can design and build it for you!</p>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
