									<h2>In-House Design and Build for Your Acrylic Water Fountain or Water Feature</h2><p>At Midwest Tropical, we take pride in the craftsmanship we offer on our acrylic waterfall and fountain designs. That is why our team consists of designers, manufacturers and installers who all work directly for us. We handle the entire process of building your water feature in-house. Your water feature is manufactured right here in the United States at our Chicago facility. This gives us control over every step of the process, so you can be certain your finished water feature will be breathtaking and durable. An acrylic waterfall or fountain will stand the test of time, bringing an upgraded look to your space while offering reliable, durable function for years to come. We pioneered water walls and bubble walls and are ready to bring our designs to your space. Let us know how we can help you today and <a href="/contact-us-2/">contact Midwest Tropical!</a></p>								</div>
